  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "Ys0VdqcIntzvIxNVbla8hrPduEk=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:54.147Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The record for Eraneos holds two things: it is an international strategy and transformation group based in Zurich, and it is enterprise scale. That is the whole basis of its priority 3 deferral \u2014 positioning plus a size bracket, with no headcount, no delivery evidence and no open-source posture assessed.\n\nThe positioning alone is worth noting, because a strategy and transformation consultancy is a different animal from a systems integrator. Its deliverable is advice and programme design rather than running software, so even a willing partner may not be the party that builds and operates the record layer. That is a question the row does not answer.\n\nThis entry is therefore best treated as a directory sighting rather than a lead assessment: confirmation that Eraneos appears as a Flowable partner in Zurich, with everything that would decide the case still to be gathered. Provenance is the Flowable Partner Finder (flowable.com/company/partners), mined 2026-08-18, and the row has not been imprint-swept.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**3 \u00b7 later**\n- Eraneos (CH Zurich) \u2014 eraneos.com\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> International strategy/transformation group. Enterprise scale \u00b7 SOURCE: Flowable Partner Finder (flowable.com/company/partners), mined 2026-08-18. NOT imprint-swept.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:30:54.147327Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:54.147332Z"
    }
  },
